# humanoid.pwe — a detailed simulated humanoid (a person-like figure) walking,
# expressed in PWE and rendered by the viewer. The skeleton is boxes (limbs,
# phalanges) and spheres (head, eyes, joints) with human colours; facial detail
# (eyes, brows, nose, mouth), two-phalanx fingers with knuckle joints, and arms
# with shoulder/elbow/wrist joints are all placed by gait kinematics in each
# `update` rule and drawn via the entity `shape`/`size`/`color`/`label`
# attributes. Parts set `label = false`; the viewer's 🏷 button toggles labels.
